It is my destiny, you fool!

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:37.840
You mean that's the reason you caused all this suffering?

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:44.340
When it is your existence itself that seals my power and causes the unbalance in this world!

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:47.340
