00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:57.840
You do the math!

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:00.000
What? The control spires!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.000
The control spire seal is power!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.990
And I was the one that built them.

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:06.200
What does this mean?

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.200
Alright, so now you know. Big deal.

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:10.120
It's Aru Kenemon.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:16.120
Our plan was a simple one: build as many control spires as possible and destroy the balance of the digital world once and for all.

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:18.140
You got a problem, so sue me.

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:21.140
And that's the reason you chose me to be the Digimon Emperor, isn't it?

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:24.150
Because you knew I would build those control spires for you.

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:25.150
You win the booby prize.

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:30.000
Unfortunately, just as construction was going along swimmingly, you decided to join forces with the other Digimon.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:33.090
and start destroying all my precious control spires.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:35.090
That's why I created you to stop them,

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:37.090
but instead you wander around the digital world

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.090
like a baby looking for its bottle.

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:41.050
Didn't it ever occur to you that Digimon like yourself

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:43.050
