00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:51.790
Don't get mad at me because fate has dealt you a bad hand!

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:52.790
Fate?

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:56.600
Then why am I standing here within an inch of destroying you?

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:57.560
Is that fate too?

00:09:57.560 --> 00:10:00.000
Blackwar, Greymon!

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:06.720
more questions than Cody does no one can answer it but you you see every life

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:11.880
has a purpose a reason the circumstances surrounding its birth don't matter

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:18.680
you're saying that my life has a meaning to precisely but it is up to you to

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:26.630
find out what that meaning is black war Greymon I have nothing more to tell you

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:30.000
unless you want to hear a good joke Jedi told me while I was in limbo

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:36.230
I'm grateful to have met you.

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:39.210
I now know that my existence has meaning.

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:46.270
Even if that meaning is only to be hated and loathed.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:56.520
Someplace where things go to disappear.

