guys are real losers oh that's clever did you write it yourself now for you digi-destined i am one of the four mega

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:33.190
who preserved the balance of the digital world.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:36.240
I protect the Eastern region.

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:38.130
Hey, that sounds like Kyoto.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:38.990
Kyoto? How?

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:41.990
Remember I told you about it? I learned it from Sora's dad.

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:45.990
The city is protected by spirits in the East, West, South, and North.

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:51.710
That's correct. There are many similarities between your world and ours.

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:55.560
After a long battle, we Guardians were sealed away by each of the Dark Masters.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:58.560
They didn't even leave us something to read.

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:00.000
It was then...

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.860
that seven of the eight Digi-Destined came to the digital world.

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:07.140
And once the seven had returned to their own world,

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:12.550
the Dark Masters dismantled it and reshaped it to fit their own needs.

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:14.360
Spiral Mountain.

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:19.410
The eight children and their Digimon were able to defeat the Dark Masters,

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:22.210
but we were still trapped beneath the seal.

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:24.060
In order to break the seal,

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:27.720
we needed to take away the power from the Digi-Destined Crescent.

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:30.000
Of course, Joe complained about it, but he...

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:34.940
complained about everything. Unfortunately, it meant that Digimon could no longer digivolve

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:38.700
to their ultimate levels. That is why our help is needed now.

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:42.940
So that's the reason our Digimon could only digivolve during certain times.

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:46.400
Hey, TK, this must be what Izzy was talking about earlier.

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:49.480
Somehow, he must have known about a Zoolongmon.

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:54.970
Yes, Izzy is quite intelligent. In fact, without that intelligence, he'd be, well, he'd be tied.

