darkness as well TK's right and the stronger the light is then the deeper the

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:50.300
darkness exactly so we have to remember that no matter how the powers of

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:53.700
darkness surround you the most important thing is not to lose the light inside

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:57.000
But I don't understand. What is the light inside?

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:00.000
The light inside is Poho.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:04.940
When all around you is darkness, you must keep the light on inside your heart.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:08.980
