00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:17.640
Once all the DigiDestined joined their hearts together, the power was born and the light shone even brighter.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:21.750
Giving the Digimon the ability to Digibond.

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:27.270
