00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:30.000
But, even though Blackwell

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:38.660
Greymon is gone, and my power will soon be restored. Beware, for the threat is not over.

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:44.870
What are you saying? The evil that tried to seal me away has not disappeared.

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:52.590
Are you talking about Arukenymon and Mummymon? No, they are merely pawns. There is an even

00:17:52.590 --> 00:18:00.000
greater hatred in existence. You mean someone else is controlling Arukenymon? Then that's who was controlling

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:02.250
Your job is not finished.

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:07.230
You must not stop until the digital world is safe once and for all.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:10.250
We'll keep one eye on the digi world and one eye on our world.

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:12.250
And we'll keep the other eye on each other.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.250
Hmm, you must be Davis.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.250
Well, despite him, I wish you all good luck in your quest.

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:18.250
Bye!

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.970
Goodbye!

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:24.230
Thanks to you, I'm able to return to my restaurant.

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:26.230
How about some treats?

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:28.230
I know they're not much, but take them, please.

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:36.160
What's the matter with you, Davis? Didn't you see me? I was reaching for that one.

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:37.900
They're all the same, aren't they?

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:40.640
Here, Ken. They're really good.

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:42.250
Aren't you going to try one?

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:46.090
Okay, I'll try one.

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:51.800
Is it good?

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:57.950
I agree.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:00.000
I said that one's mine!

00:19:04.890 --> 00:19:06.390
Chinese buns were great!

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:07.890
You had one more than me.

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:09.490
Well, I didn't know you were counting.

00:19:09.490 --> 00:19:10.590
Let me tell you something.

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:12.590
When it comes to food, I always count.

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:17.690
What are you looking at?

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:21.390
Well, I'm not exactly sure, but I think I just saw a control spire.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.590
You should try wearing those goggles once in a while.

00:19:23.590 --> 00:19:27.270
Control spire? Yeah, right.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.880
I don't care what Yo-Li says.

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.000
I know what I saw.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.130
What is this new evil that Azulongmon spoke of?

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:35.230
Are the Digidestines strong enough to face it?

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:38.210
Find out on the next Digimon Digital Monsters.
